      "id",
      "object",
      "choices"
    ],
    "notes": "观测 stream=true 且未传 stream_options.include_usage 时，SSE 是否含 usage chunk。阿里文档默认不返回；部分 OpenAI-compatible 渠道仍始终返回 usage。case 始终 pass，用于 V02 横向对比各渠道行为。"
  }
}
